---

## 4. Templates

### 4.1 React Query Keys Factory

```typescript
export const studentKeys = {
  all: ['students'] as const,
  lists: () => [...studentKeys.all, 'list'] as const,
  list: (filters: StudentListFilters) => [...studentKeys.lists(), filters] as const,
  details: () => [...studentKeys.all, 'detail'] as const,
  detail: (id: string) => [...studentKeys.details(), id] as const,
};
```

### 4.2 API Layer

```typescript
export const studentsApi = {
  list: (filters: StudentListFilters) =>
    apiClient.get<ApiResponse<PagedResult<StudentDto>>>('/students', { params: filters }),
  get: (id: string) =>
    apiClient.get<ApiResponse<StudentDto>>(`/students/${id}`),
  create: (data: CreateStudentDto) =>
    apiClient.post<ApiResponse<StudentDto>>('/students', data),
  update: (id: string, data: UpdateStudentDto) =>
    apiClient.put<ApiResponse<StudentDto>>(`/students/${id}`, data),
  remove: (id: string) =>
    apiClient.delete(`/students/${id}`),
};
```

### 4.3 Page Component

```tsx
export default function StudentsPage() {
  const { t } = useTranslation('students');
  const { can } = usePermission();
  const isMobile = useIsMobile();
  const [filters, setFilters] = useState<StudentListFilters>(defaultFilters);
  const [editing, setEditing] = useState<StudentDto | null>(null);
  const [creating, setCreating] = useState(false);

  const { data, isLoading, isError, refetch } = useStudentsQuery(filters);

  if (isError) return <ErrorState onRetry={refetch} />;
  if (isLoading) return <DataGridSkeleton />;
  if (!data?.items.length && !filters.search) {
    return <EmptyState
      icon={<UsersIcon />}
      title={t('empty.title')}
      description={t('empty.description')}
      action={can('students.create') && (
        <Button onClick={() => setCreating(true)}>{t('actions.create')}</Button>
      )}
    />;
  }

  return (
    <PageLayout
      title={t('title')}
      actions={
        <PageActions>
          {can('students.export') && <ExportButton onClick={handleExport} />}
          {can('students.create') && (
            <Button onClick={() => setCreating(true)} icon={<PlusIcon />}>
              {t('actions.create')}
            </Button>
          )}
        </PageActions>
      }
    >
      <StudentFilterBar value={filters} onChange={setFilters} />

      {isMobile ? (
        <StudentMobileList
          data={data.items}
          onEdit={setEditing}
          totalCount={data.totalCount}
          page={filters.page}
          onPageChange={(page) => setFilters((f) => ({ ...f, page }))}
        />
      ) : (
        <StudentDataGrid
          data={data.items}
          totalCount={data.totalCount}
          loading={isLoading}
          onEdit={setEditing}
          onDelete={handleDelete}
          filters={filters}
          onFiltersChange={setFilters}
        />
      )}

      <StudentFormModal
        open={creating || !!editing}
        student={editing}
        onClose={() => { setCreating(false); setEditing(null); }}
      />
    </PageLayout>
  );
}
```

### 4.4 Mutation Hook

```typescript
export function useStudentMutation() {
  const queryClient = useQueryClient();
  const { t } = useTranslation('students');

  return useMutation({
    mutationFn: ({ id, data }: SaveStudentInput) =>
      id ? studentsApi.update(id, data) : studentsApi.create(data),
    onSuccess: () => {
      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: studentKeys.lists() });
      toast.success(t('messages.saved'));
    },
    onError: (error) => {
      handleServerValidationError(error) || toast.error(t('messages.error'));
    },
  });
}
```

### 4.5 Modal Form

```tsx
export function StudentFormModal({ open, student, onClose }: Props) {
  const { t } = useTranslation('students');
  const form = useForm<StudentFormValues>({
    resolver: zodResolver(studentSchema),
    defaultValues: student ?? defaultValues,
  });
  const mutation = useStudentMutation();

  const onSubmit = (values: StudentFormValues) => {
    mutation.mutate({ id: student?.id, data: values }, { onSuccess: onClose });
  };

  return (
    <Modal open={open} onClose={onClose} title={student ? t('edit.title') : t('create.title')}>
      <FormProvider {...form}>
        <form onSubmit={form.handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className="space-y-4">
          <FormField name="firstName" label={t('fields.firstName')} required />
          <FormField name="lastName" label={t('fields.lastName')} required />
          <FormSelectField name="classSectionId" label={t('fields.class')} options={classOptions} required />
          <FormActions>
            <Button variant="ghost" onClick={onClose} type="button">{t('actions.cancel')}</Button>
            <Button type="submit" loading={mutation.isPending}>{t('actions.save')}</Button>
          </FormActions>
        </form>
      </FormProvider>
    </Modal>
  );
}
```

---

## 5. Zorunlu UX

- **Loading:** Skeleton (boş satırlar), spinner değil.
- **Empty:** İllüstrasyon + CTA.
- **Error:** Retry button + destek metni.
- **Toast:** Save sonrası tek toast (multiple yok).
- **Validation:** Inline error + scroll-to-first-error.
- **Server error mapping:** 422 ValidationProblemDetails → form field error.
- **Permission gate:** Add/edit/delete buton `can()` ile gizlenir.
- **Mobile:** DataGrid → card list otomatik.
- **Confirmation:** Delete için modal (ESC + dış tıklamada kapanmaz).

---

## 6. Permission Integration

```tsx
const { can } = usePermission();
{can('students.create') && <Button>...</Button>}
{can('students.edit') && <EditAction />}
{can('students.delete') && <DeleteAction />}
```

Permission isimleri `permission-matrix.md` ile birebir.

---

## 7. AI Checklist (CRUD ekran üretiminde)

- [ ] Folder structure `src/features/{module}/...` mi?
- [ ] React Query keys factory ayrı dosyada mı?
- [ ] API layer axios call'ları DTO type'lı mı?
- [ ] Zod schema + RHF resolver entegre mi?
- [ ] DataGrid wrapper (server-side) kullanıldı mı?
- [ ] Mobile card list fallback var mı?
- [ ] Permission `can()` check her aksiyonda mı?
- [ ] Loading / empty / error 3 state ayrı handle mi?
- [ ] Toast tek (success / error)?
- [ ] Server validation error → form field error mapping?
- [ ] i18n key'ler `students.json` (tr/en) eklendi mi?
- [ ] Route + menu permission'a göre mi gözüküyor?

---

## 8. Output Format

```
[crud-page-generator]
✅ 15 dosya üretildi (page, hooks, api, schema, components, types, i18n)
✅ Permission gating: students.create / edit / delete
✅ Mobile fallback: StudentMobileList
✅ Server-side DataGrid
✅ RHF + Zod entegrasyonu
✅ Loading + empty + error state
```

---

## 9. Yasak

- Sadece component üretip hook/api'yi atlamak.
- DataGrid'i wrapper'sız doğrudan import etmek.
- Permission check'i atlamak (server-side var ama UI'da da gerekli).
- Toast'u her field error için ayrı atmak.
- Empty state'i "no data" text ile geçmek.
- Modal'ı `<dialog>` veya custom div ile yapmak (`<Modal>` wrapper şart).
- i18n key atlamak / hardcoded Türkçe yazmak.
